{"id":"22.11.HomeDesign","contentHtml":"<h3><strong>Home Design (Playgendary)</strong> | Lead Unity Developer / Technical Owner</h3>\n<p>My path on the <em>Home Design</em> project was unique. I started on it as a Unity Developer, but soon its large team was disbanded, and I was transferred to other company projects.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Over the next 10 months, I established myself as a strong and reliable specialist</strong>. Therefore, when the management decided to resume active development of <em>Home Design</em>, <strong>I was entrusted to return to it — already in the role of, de facto, <code>Technical Owner</code></strong>. This project captivated me so much that I often worked 12 hours a day, fully immersing myself in the role of a leader and taking responsibility for a product with an audience of <strong>5+ million downloads</strong>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2>Challenge</h2>\n<p>The key challenge was <strong>leadership and architectural</strong>: I was appointed responsible for a <strong>mobile AAA project in live-ops</strong> under conditions where <strong>knowledge about it was practically lost</strong>. In conditions of <strong>extensive but incomplete documentation and limited expertise</strong>, it was required to quickly conduct reverse engineering of the architecture, <strong>form and lead a new team</strong>, and establish the delivery of critical features.</p>\n<h2>My Role and Decisions</h2>\n<p>As Lead Developer, I acted not just as a manager, but as the <strong><code>Technical Owner</code> of the product</strong>.</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Architectural Ownership and Reverse Engineering:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>Conducted <strong>deep reverse engineering</strong> of the codebase, studying all available documentation and <strong>restoring lost knowledge</strong> about the architecture. In the shortest possible time, I became the main technical expert on the project.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Team Formation and Leadership:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Formed and led a new development team.</strong> I was responsible for task decomposition, setting deadlines, <strong>conducting regular code reviews</strong>, and mentorship.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Direct Impact on Product (Monetization and Live-Ops):</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Designed and drove the implementation</strong> of key monetization features: from new <code>Rewarded Video</code> placements to <strong>premium subscription</strong>.</li>\n<li>Personally engaged in <strong>increasing project stability</strong>, fixing hard-to-reproduce bugs from <code>Crashlytics</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Strategic Communication:</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Represented the development team on calls with management</strong> and product managers, participating in planning and defending technical solutions.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>Outcome</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Successful Project \"Revival\":</strong> I successfully took control of a complex legacy project, established processes, and ensured stable release of updates.</li>\n<li><strong>Key Career Growth:</strong> This experience became <mark>decisive in my professional formation</mark>. I honed skills in practice not only in team leadership but also in <strong>architectural audit, reverse engineering, and crisis management</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Measurable Impact on Product:</strong> My work and my team's decisions directly contributed to increasing monetization metrics and improving the stability of one of the company's main hits.</li>\n</ul>\n","published":true,"title":"Home Design","date":"2022-11","type":"project","tagsArray":["Mobile","Puzzle","Unity","C#"],"heroVideo":null,"shortDescription":"<p>My experience at Playgendary: <mark>acted as <strong>Technical Owner</strong></mark> on the AAA hit <em>Home Design</em>, conducting architectural reverse-engineering and leading a new team.</p>\n","storeLinks":["https://newplg.dev/","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.playgendary.homes","https://apps.apple.com/ru/app/design-masters/id1495346254"],"role":"lead","projectIcon":"/images/projects/22.11.HomeDesign/icon.webp","cardBackground":"/images/projects/22.11.HomeDesign/card.mp4?v=1765047169096","screenshots":[{"src":"/images/projects/22.11.HomeDesign/screenshots/0.webp","width":500,"height":1080},{"src":"/images/projects/22.11.HomeDesign/screenshots/1.webp","width":500,"height":1080},{"src":"/images/projects/22.11.HomeDesign/screenshots/2.webp","width":500,"height":1080},{"src":"/images/projects/22.11.HomeDesign/screenshots/3.webp","width":500,"height":1080}]}